abstract: >-
  An unrefereed combined theorem candidate. Relative to named classification
  inputs, it gives the all-degree fixed-seed coefficient atlas at cyclic rank
  at most three and all rank-preserving polynomial extensions. It also treats
  arbitrary polynomial amplitudes, specified zero-cycles, persistent endpoint
  moments for Atlas phases, and an exact local Laurent coefficient criterion.
  External reproduction, complete formalisation, peer review, and priority
  certification remain outstanding.
